{"3169570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Travel Agency Simulator", "steam_appid": 3169570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169570/extras/97eb8bc041fbc2ba393e610e03993e17.avif?t=1788011366\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169570/extras_big/97eb8bc041fbc2ba393e610e03993e17.avif?t=1788011366 width=1560 height=1218 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD. AUTOMATE. EXPAND YOUR TRAVEL EMPIRE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a single desk and a basic city tour. Serve travelers, reinvest every sale, and unlock a worldwide network of museum passes, hotels, cruises, transfers, resorts, and landmark experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each destination becomes a new revenue stream to upgrade, automate, and master on your journey from neighborhood agency to global travel empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169570/extras/91815178bc0da6ee7c61fee05da64fa3.avif?t=1788011366\" width=1170 height=658 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DESIGN YOUR OFFICE.  AUTOMATE YOUR SUCCESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every booking earns cash. Reinvest your profits to improve each destination’s speed, capacity, and income, then automate successful routes so the money keeps flowing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fine-tune your upgrades, unlock powerful multipliers, and watch a modest travel agency become an unstoppable revenue machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169570/extras/2bc492bd65c97bb3eef4f057910af906.poster.avif?t=1788011366\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169570/extras/2bc492bd65c97bb3eef4f057910af906.webm?t=1788011366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169570/extras/2bc492bd65c97bb3eef4f057910af906.mp4?t=1788011366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PRESTIGE. RETURN STRONGER.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reset your branch to earn Reputation and unlock permanent prestige upgrades. Sacrifice short-term progress to gain lasting bonuses that make every new agency faster and more powerful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebuild with greater revenue, improved speed, stronger starting resources, expanded offline earnings, and more—then push your travel empire further than before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169570/extras/db914d6451c011d186da0fb0566cf1ce.poster.avif?t=1788011366\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169570/extras/db914d6451c011d186da0fb0566cf1ce.webm?t=1788011366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169570/extras/db914d6451c011d186da0fb0566cf1ce.mp4?t=1788011366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLICK. UPGRADE. AUTOMATE.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn every travel product into a growing revenue stream. Reinvest your earnings to improve speed, capacity, and profit across tours, hotels, cruises, transfers, and landmark experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy upgrades in bulk, automate routine operations, and watch your agency generate increasingly massive returns—even while you focus on the next destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169570/extras/147e9246bb1d7ffe23a9bf6b93c90a4d.poster.avif?t=1788011366\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169570/extras/147e9246bb1d7ffe23a9bf6b93c90a4d.webm?t=1788011366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169570/extras/147e9246bb1d7ffe23a9bf6b93c90a4d.mp4?t=1788011366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RUN YOUR INTERACTIVE OFFICE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step away from the main agency board and enter your 3D office. Match destination cards to each traveler, complete their request, and earn gold and fame as a steady queue of customers arrives. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve visitors hands-on whenever you want a change of pace, then return to building your worldwide travel empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169570/extras/bae8c9568ede008f25bf41cbaa710234.poster.avif?t=1788011366\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169570/extras/bae8c9568ede008f25bf41cbaa710234.webm?t=1788011366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169570/extras/bae8c9568ede008f25bf41cbaa710234.mp4?t=1788011366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONTRACTS, SEASONS, AND TROPHIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on focused contracts that challenge you to expand specific routes, purchase upgrades, and reach clear milestones. Seasonal shifts keep the agency changing, while a packed trophy gallery records achievements earned across every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete more goals, build your reputation, and give every new agency another objective beyond the next upgrade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169570/extras/4fe2d67300bbfd6d2917bf477023da39.poster.avif?t=1788011366\" width=1170 height=546 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169570/extras/4fe2d67300bbfd6d2917bf477023da39.webm?t=1788011366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169570/extras/4fe2d67300bbfd6d2917bf477023da39.mp4?t=1788011366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169570/extras/97eb8bc041fbc2ba393e610e03993e17.avif?t=1788011366\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169570/extras_big/97eb8bc041fbc2ba393e610e03993e17.avif?t=1788011366 width=1560 height=1218 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD. AUTOMATE. EXPAND YOUR TRAVEL EMPIRE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a single desk and a basic city tour. Serve travelers, reinvest every sale, and unlock a worldwide network of museum passes, hotels, cruises, transfers, resorts, and landmark experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each destination becomes a new revenue stream to upgrade, automate, and master on your journey from neighborhood agency to global travel empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169570/extras/91815178bc0da6ee7c61fee05da64fa3.avif?t=1788011366\" width=1170 height=658 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DESIGN YOUR OFFICE.  AUTOMATE YOUR SUCCESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every booking earns cash. Reinvest your profits to improve each destination’s speed, capacity, and income, then automate successful routes so the money keeps flowing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fine-tune your upgrades, unlock powerful multipliers, and watch a modest travel agency become an unstoppable revenue machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169570/extras/2bc492bd65c97bb3eef4f057910af906.poster.avif?t=1788011366\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169570/extras/2bc492bd65c97bb3eef4f057910af906.webm?t=1788011366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169570/extras/2bc492bd65c97bb3eef4f057910af906.mp4?t=1788011366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PRESTIGE. RETURN STRONGER.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reset your branch to earn Reputation and unlock permanent prestige upgrades. Sacrifice short-term progress to gain lasting bonuses that make every new agency faster and more powerful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebuild with greater revenue, improved speed, stronger starting resources, expanded offline earnings, and more—then push your travel empire further than before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169570/extras/db914d6451c011d186da0fb0566cf1ce.poster.avif?t=1788011366\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169570/extras/db914d6451c011d186da0fb0566cf1ce.webm?t=1788011366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169570/extras/db914d6451c011d186da0fb0566cf1ce.mp4?t=1788011366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLICK. UPGRADE. AUTOMATE.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn every travel product into a growing revenue stream. Reinvest your earnings to improve speed, capacity, and profit across tours, hotels, cruises, transfers, and landmark experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy upgrades in bulk, automate routine operations, and watch your agency generate increasingly massive returns—even while you focus on the next destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169570/extras/147e9246bb1d7ffe23a9bf6b93c90a4d.poster.avif?t=1788011366\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169570/extras/147e9246bb1d7ffe23a9bf6b93c90a4d.webm?t=1788011366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169570/extras/147e9246bb1d7ffe23a9bf6b93c90a4d.mp4?t=1788011366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RUN YOUR INTERACTIVE OFFICE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step away from the main agency board and enter your 3D office. Match destination cards to each traveler, complete their request, and earn gold and fame as a steady queue of customers arrives. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve visitors hands-on whenever you want a change of pace, then return to building your worldwide travel empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169570/extras/bae8c9568ede008f25bf41cbaa710234.poster.avif?t=1788011366\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169570/extras/bae8c9568ede008f25bf41cbaa710234.webm?t=1788011366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169570/extras/bae8c9568ede008f25bf41cbaa710234.mp4?t=1788011366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONTRACTS, SEASONS, AND TROPHIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on focused contracts that challenge you to expand specific routes, purchase upgrades, and reach clear milestones. Seasonal shifts keep the agency changing, while a packed trophy gallery records achievements earned across every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete more goals, build your reputation, and give every new agency another objective beyond the next upgrade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169570/extras/4fe2d67300bbfd6d2917bf477023da39.poster.avif?t=1788011366\" width=1170 height=546 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169570/extras/4fe2d67300bbfd6d2917bf477023da39.webm?t=1788011366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169570/extras/4fe2d67300bbfd6d2917bf477023da39.mp4?t=1788011366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Build a global travel empire through idle-clicker management, then step inside your agency in an interactive 3D office minigame. Sell and upgrade travel products, hire managers, automate profits, serve customers, customize your office, and prestige for permanent boosts.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169570/afb469c6d850147cdea82c85b76073b1499562ad/header.jpg?t=1788011366", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169570/727b41816b72a9ae3c4914f71ff8e33c6a84d793/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788011366", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169570/727b41816b72a9ae3c4914f71ff8e33c6a84d793/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788011366", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 or AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 530, NVIDIA GeForce GT 730, AMD Radeon R7 240, or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6500 or AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti, AMD Radeon RX 460, or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ν/Α<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ν/Α<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Ν/Α<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Ν/Α<br></li><li><strong>Additi